A scheduled result is visible; private receipts verify both confirmation forms returned the same campaign ID.

8
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:20.000
8. Ended before the configured start
Completed before its future start; dates remain configured. Private readback verifies zero price-write audits.

9
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:30.000
9. Unsupported requests are refused
ChatGPT refuses direct markdowns, launching without review, and customer email.

10
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:40.000
